<title>USA: GOLF-THIRD-ROUND LEADERS AT LAS VEGAS INVITATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-THIRD-ROUND LEADERS AT LAS VEGAS INVITATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the third round</p>
<p>of the $1.65 million Las Vegas Invitational golf tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>195 Rick Fehr 64 62 69</p>
<p>197 Davis Love III 66 67 64, Fred Funk 66 63 68</p>
<p>198 Ronnie Black 64 65 69</p>
<p>199 David Ogrin 69 63 67, Fred Couples 66 67 66, Keith Fergus</p>
<p>62 70 67</p>
<p>201 John Cook 72 64 65, Jim Furyk 66 64 71,Tiger Woods 70 63</p>
<p>68, Lee Janzen 66 65 70, Paulu Azinger 67 64 70.</p>
<p>202 Craig Stadler 67 69 66, Dave Stockton Jr. 67 68 67, Mike</p>
<p>Sullivan 64 72 66, Mike Heinen 66 69 67.</p>
<p>203 Clarence Rose 68 66 69, John Maginnes 69 69 65, David</p>
<p>Duval 69 68 66, Scott McCarron 68 66 69, David Edwards 68 66</p>
<p>69, Don Pooley 68 66 69.</p>
<p>Other international players</p>
<p>205 Fulton Allem (South Africa) 73 66 66, Vijay Singh 66 68</p>
<p>71</p>
<p>206 Stuart Appleby (Australia) 73 67 66</p>
<p>207 David Frost (South Africa) 65 71 71, Craig Parry</p>
<p>(Australia) 68 67 72.</p>
<p>209 Steve Rintoul (Australia) 71 67 71</p>
<p>214 Grant Waite (New Zealand) 73 69 72</p>
<p>217 Denis Watson (Zimbabwe) 71 73 73</p>
